{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A kit with Marksman Sokol in his Fort Epic Outfit as well as Coins and days of Premium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This kit contains:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Marksman Sokol from the Alpha collection:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sokol acts calmly and precisely. He's a perfectionist, and can eliminate an enemy with one clean shot to the head from his AWSM sniper rifle, which is effective even at great distances.\u00a0 He also carries a PMN-4 mine which helps him defend his emplacement against unwelcome guests. Sokol's Bullet Rain ability greatly increases his rate of fire, lets him quickly reload without breaking aim and helps him eliminate foes in rapid succession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fort Epic Outfit for Sokol:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An alternative outfit for the operator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10,000 Coins:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coins can be spent on operators, customization items, and progress boosting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30 days of Premium:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Premium speeds up in-game progress and unlocks Premium objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 +20% XP if all teammates have active Premium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u2014 +10% XP for all teammates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 +100% XP in all types of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 +30% XP in the new Battle Pass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014\u00a0Increases gained Karma Points by 20%.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2440197?t=1746017450","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/sto